,"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\mu,\\lambda,\\nu,\\rho,M,N,X,Y,\\varphi,C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\kappa,\\mu,\\lambda,\\nu,\\rho,M,N,X,Y,\\varphi,C\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^n\">\\(V^n\\)</span> 是域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的集合函数的元语言类；有限元组采用相同编码，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C_0,C_1,C_2,C_3\\rangle\\in V^4\">\\(\\langle C_0,C_1,C_2,C_3\\rangle\\in V^4\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\psi,\\vec a)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\psi,\\vec a)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a762f9d6c343e3a0\" href=\"?note=a762f9d6c343e3a0\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class.md</a> 的公式—参数编码与元语言外延。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> 使用所列依赖。所有类成员关系及类相等式均在同一元语言中解释。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\psi,\\vec a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(C)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi,\\vec a\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\psi,\\vec a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,i)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ni\\in4\\land\\exists\\vec C\\in V^4\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\vec C\\land\\bigl[\\forall j\\in4\\;\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(\\vec C(j))\\bigr]\n\\land x\\in\\operatorname{Ext}(\\vec C(i))\\bigr),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,0),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,1),\\\\\nx\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,2),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,3),\\\\\nM\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\langle M,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,i)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\ni\\in4\\land\\exists\\vec C\\in V^4\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal L=\\vec C\\land\\bigl[\\forall j\\in4\\;\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(\\vec C(j))\\bigr]\n\\land x\\in\\operatorname{Ext}(\\vec C(i))\\bigr),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,0),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,1),\\\\\nx\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,2),\\\\\nx\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{LogicDecode}_{58,\\mathsf{meta}}(x,\\mathcal L,3),\\\\\nM\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\langle M,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}logic\\text{-}presentation}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec C\\in V^4\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal L=\\vec C\\land\n\\forall i\\in4\\;\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(\\vec C(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\models_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl(z\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;(z=\\langle M,\\varphi\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl(z\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists X\\in V\\;(z=\\langle M,X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists!X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle M,X\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}logic\\text{-}presentation}\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec C\\in V^4\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal L=\\vec C\\land\n\\forall i\\in4\\;\\mathrm{LogicClassCode}_{58,S}(\\vec C(i))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\models_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathrm{Class}_S(\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl(z\\in\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;(z=\\langle M,\\varphi\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl[\\forall z\\in V\\;\\bigl(z\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists X\\in V\\;(z=\\langle M,X\\rangle)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists!X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle M,X\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}hanf\\text{-}bound}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\nu,X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\n\\land\\mu\\le\\nu\\land\\langle M,X\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\land X\\approx\\nu\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mu\\le\\lambda\\to\n\\exists N\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\rho,Y\\in V\\;(\nN\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\rho)\n\\land\\lambda\\le\\rho\\land\\langle N,Y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\land Y\\approx\\rho)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}hanf\\text{-}bound}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\nu,X\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(M\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\nu)\n\\land\\mu\\le\\nu\\land\\langle M,X\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\land X\\approx\\nu\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mu\\le\\lambda\\to\n\\exists N\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\rho,Y\\in V\\;(\nN\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\rho)\n\\land\\lambda\\le\\rho\\land\\langle N,Y\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Univ}_{\\mathcal L}\\land Y\\approx\\rho)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}hanf\\text{-}number}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}hanf\\text{-}number}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\quad\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9HanfNumber}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicPresentation}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{HanfBound}_{\\mathcal L}(\\mu)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原有 Hanf 界条件：单个句子出现一个足够大的模型，就有任意大的模型；不擅加逻辑的紧致性、同构不变性或语法闭包公理。</li>\n<li>逻辑的四个组成部分现由同一集合编码确定，而不是与该编码无关的四个外加参数。载体投影是全定义的单值类关系，不假定模型类本身为集合。</li>\n<li>无效四元组的解码外延为空；最终谓词仍显式要求有效 presentation，因此该约定不增加 Hanf 数实例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":